# INVWINVC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the views of
# Items > Loans and holds, a row's item and the hold keys by level.  At
# level 2 (CLERK) CTRL+L lends item 1, due in 2020; CTRL+R reserves one
# of item 2's drives for the club until 2020; CTRL+U marks item 3 in use
# with item 1, its ID typed.  Items > Loans and holds shows the three
# open rows, each with its kind, the late ones marked; CTRL-PGDN goes on to
# the open loans, the open reservations, the uses, the overdue rows, the
# loan and the reservation, and every row, each titled.  ENTER on the
# reservation shows it in its own form, labelled for a reservation.  Open
# item (ALT-C I) on the use shows its item, item 3, in the item form,
# whose Loans button, clicked, lists its loans and holds; ESC there
# shows the form over the list again, whose Used with button, clicked,
# shows that nothing is used with item 3, and ESC closes it.
# The Record menu holds Open item, Lend, Reserve and Use with, and
# CTRL+R asks for the item of a new reservation.  At level 1 (READER)
# CTRL+R on an item and on the list show INV's refusal in a message box.
# The end by Exit.  Every date is typed, so that no snapshot holds the
# day of the run.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINVC.SNP is its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
# a loan of item 1: the borrower, past the contact, the dates
K CTRL-L TAB
T Ann Smith
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-02-01
K ENTER
# a reservation of item 2, until a date past
K DOWN CTRL-R TAB
T Club show
K TAB TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K TAB
T 2020-01-10
K ENTER
# item 3 in use with item 1
K DOWN CTRL-U TAB TAB
T 1
K TAB TAB
T 2020-01-01
K ENTER
S ITEMS
K ALT-I O
S OPEN
K CPGDN
S LOANS
K CPGDN
S RESERVED
K CPGDN
S INUSE
K CPGDN
S OVERDUE
K CPGDN
S ALL
K CPGDN DOWN ENTER
S RESFORM
K ESC UP ALT-C I
S ITEM
M 150 DOWN MID
M 150 UP MID
S HOLDS
K ESC
S BACK
M 151 DOWN MID
M 151 UP MID
S HOSTED
K ESC ESC ALT-C
S MENU
K ESC ESC CTRL-R
S ASKRES
K ESC ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER CTRL-R
S NORES
K ENTER ALT-I O CTRL-R
S NORES2
K ENTER ALT-F X
